$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-4-(2-methoxyphenyl )penta-2,4-dienamide (entry 10).
Lithium chloride (17.4 mg, 0.40 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
1-(2-methoxyphenyl)vinyl diphenyl phosphate (198.8 mg, 0.52 mmol),
N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol),
PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in DMF (3 mL) were reacted for
24 h at 100°C. Thecrude product was purified by flash chromatography on
silica gel using CH2Cl2:ethyl acetate (99:1) as eluent. This afforded 92
mg of the title compound (89 % yield) as a white solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz,
C6D6) δ (ppm) 7.49 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 7.12 (m, 1H), 7.02 (m, 1H), 6.82
(dd, 1H, J = 7.2, 0.8 Hz), 6.71 (d, 1H, J = 8.4 Hz), 5.70 (bs, 1H, NH),
5.60 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 5.47 (m, 1H), 5.16 (d, 1H, J = 2.0 Hz), 3.42
(s, 3H), 1.19 (s, 9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, C6D6) δ (ppm) 165.2, 157.2,
145.0, 140.9, 130.9, 129.4, 129.0, 125.8, 123.3, 120.7, 111.4, 55.4,
50.9, 28.6. HRMS C16H21NO2 [M+Na+]: 282.1470 found: 282.1468.
