$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for Intramolecular
Asymmetric Heck Cyclizations. Preparation of
(S)-1-Benzyl-3-(2-methoxyvinyl)-3-phenyl-1,3-dihydroindol-2-one, (S)-12.
A base-washed and oven-dried 10 mL sealable tube equipped with a magnetic
stir bar was charged with 10 (98 mg, 0.19 mmol, 1.0 equiv), PMP (0.14 mL,
0.78 mmol, 4.0 equiv), and THF (0.8 mL). This solution was deoxygenated
by bubbling Ar through a submerged needle for 20 min, and Pd(OAc)2 (2.2
mg, 9.7 μmol, 5 mol %) and (R)-BINAP (12 mg, 19 μmol, 10 mol %) were then
added. Deoxygenation and vigorous stirring were continued for 15 min,
during which time a red solution resulted. The tube then was sealed and
heated at 80 °C for 6 h. After cooling to room temperature, the solution
was diluted with EtOAc (10 mL) and washed with NaHCO3 (3 × 10 mL). The
organic layer was dried (Na2SO4), filtered, and concentrated. The residue
was purified by flash chromatography (9:1 hexanes-ethyl acetate).
1,1'-Dibenzyl-3-(2-methoxyvinyl)-1,3,2',3'-tetrahydro-1H'[3,7']biindolyl-2-one
(18g). The general procedure for Heck cyclization was followed using
triflate 11g (160 mg, 0.250 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (5.6 mg, 0.025 mmol, 10
mol%), (R)-BINAP (31 mg, 0.050 mmol, 20 mol%) and PMP (0.180 mL, 1.00
mmol) in THF (2.5 mL) with a reaction time of 18 h. The crude product was
purified by silica gel chromatography (EtOAc-hexanes, 2:8, v/v) to
provide 18g (105 mg, 87%, 9:1 mixture of E:Z enol ether stereoisomers) as
a colorless amorphous solid. 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3, major isomer) δ 7.59
(d, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 7.40-7.21 (m, 8H), 7.16-6.96 (m, 7H), 6.31 (d, J =
7.7 Hz, 1H), 6.11 (d, J = 12.8 Hz, 1H), 5.39 (d, J = 12.8 Hz, 1H), 5.17
(d, J = 15.9 Hz, 1H), 3.63-3.53 (m, 2H), 3.60 (s, 3H), 3.42 (d, J = 15.9
Hz, 1H), 3.10-2.97 (m, 3H), 2.71-2.66 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3,
major isomer) δ 177.3, 152.1, 149.5, 141.9, 139.7, 137.9, 136.3, 129.2,
129.1, 128.5, 127.9, 127.4, 127.3, 127.3, 127.2, 127.0, 126.3, 124.7,
123.5, 122.3, 109.6, 107.2, 58.0, 56.8, 54.2, 43.4, 29.3; IR (film) 1715,
1608; HRMS (LSIMSFAB) calcd for C33H31N2O2 (M+H)+: 487.2385; found
487.2388.
