McCulla, Ryan D.; Huang, Qinhua; Zhao, Jian; Jenks, William S.; Larock,
Richard C.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2007), 129(19), 6298-6307

