$DATUM (E)-4-Benzhydryl-N-tert-butyl penta-2,4-dienamide (entry 6).Lithium
chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
1,1-diphenylprop-2-enyl diphenylphosphate (265.5 mg, 0.60 mmol),
N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol),
PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in a 1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3
mL) were reacted for 24 h at 100°C. The crude product was purified by
flash chromatography on silica gel using CH2Cl2:ethyl acetate (99:1) as
eluent. This afforded 106 mg of the title compound (83% yield) as a
colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CD2Cl2) δ (ppm) 7.22-7.18 (m, 4H),
7.16-7.11 (m, 3H), 7.04-7.02 (m, 4H), 5.68 (d, 1H, J = 15.6 Hz), 5.58 (s,
1H), 5.32 (bs, 1H, NH), 5.02 (s, 1H), 4.82 (s, 1H), 1.21 (s, 9H). 13C NMR
(100 MHz, CD2Cl2) 165.0, 147.0, 142.3, 141.6, 129.4, 128.6, 126.8, 125.5,
123.4, 53.6, 51.3, 28.7. HRMS C22H25NO [M+Na+]: 342.1834 found: 342.1844.
